      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the augmented matrix $V,$ given by\n\n$$\nV=\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-8 & -6 & 4 \\\\ -2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 9 & 6\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nWhat matrix results from carrying out the row operation $R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2}$ on $V?$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The operation $R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2}$ means that we need to swap the first and second rows.\n\nApplying this row operation, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V &= \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-8 & -6 & 4 \\\\ -2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 9 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\\,R_{1}\\leftrightarrow R_{2} \\\\ &\\sim \\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-2 & -4 & -2 \\\\ -8 & -6 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 9 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
